abstract: >-
  A Lean library for deterministic, randomized, and quantum algorithms that
  access a graph only through cut queries. It proves query bounds for weighted
  cut sparsification, randomized, deterministic, and quantum global minimum
  cut, minimum-cut certificates, all-pairs minimum cuts and Gomory–Hu
  reductions, and directed minimum cuts and certificates. Every algorithm is an
  explicit query program whose budget, error probability, and output contract
  are proved, and an axiom audit checks each audited declaration.
